               x10 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17
               (Z_to_bv 64 NC) (Z_to_bv 64 (c_TLP C)) (Z_to_bv 64 (zlen buf)) (Z_to_bv 64 msv1) x22 x23 x24 x25 x26 x27 x28 x29 x30 x31)
